#: res://lore/characters/flower-shop-owner.md
msgid "lore.characters.flower-shop-owner.body"
msgstr "# 花店老板\n\n- 状态: alive\n- 首次登场: 花店（`04_flower_shop`）\n- 当前所在地: [花店](locations/flower-shop.md)\n- 年龄/生日: unknown\n- 身份/职业: 花店老板\n- 关系: [无名王](characters/protagonist.md) - 顾客\n- 物品: unknown\n- 已知信息:\n  - 在花店低头玩手机，玩家进入后才会互动。（来源：docs/Dialogic_Implementation_Guide.md）\n  - 可提供蚯蚓；花篮（hualan）与假花（jiahua）相关选项由此处展开。（来源：docs/Dialogic_Implementation_Guide.md）\n- 时间线备注: 04_flower_shop，可多次到访（visit_huadian 计数）"

#: res://lore/characters/flower-shop-owner.md
